flowchart TB
    Select[User selects Profile B] --> Save[Save required Profile A state]
    Save --> Transition[Transition Profile A lifecycle]
    Transition --> Load[Load Profile B]
    Load --> Network[Apply Profile B network configuration]
    Network --> Identity[Apply Profile B identity configuration]
    Identity --> Restore[Restore browser state]
    Restore --> Ready[Profile B ready]
    Ready -. avoid unnecessary full app restart .-> Select

